,{"t":", and his "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[8]},{"t":" are not "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[10]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":17,"text":"The words of the wise spoken quietly are heeded more than the shouting of a ruler among fools.","tok":[{"t":"The "},{"t":"words","s":["H1697"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"wise","s":["H2450"],"a":[1]},{"t":" "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H8085"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"quietly","s":["H5183"],"a":[2]},{"t":" are heeded more than the shouting of a ruler among "},{"t":"fools","s":["H3684"],"a":[6]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":18,"text":"Wisdom is better than weapons of war, but one sinner destroys much good.","tok":[{"t":"Wisdom","s":["H2451"],"a":[1]},{"t":" is "},{"t":"better","s":["H2896"],"a":[0]},{"t":" than "},{"t":"weapons","s":["H3627"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"war","s":["H7128"],"a":[3]},{"t":", but "},{"t":"one","s":["H0259"],"a":[5]},{"t":" "},{"t":"sinner","s":["H2398"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"destroys","s":["H0006"],"a":[6]},{"t":" "},{"t":"much","s":["H7235"],"a":[8]},{"t":" "},{"t":"good","s":["H2896"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]}]}
